{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52094","headline":"舞剑歌 · 李靖","name":"舞剑歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陟崇冈兮望四围，□□闪□兮断虹飞，嗟嗟三军唱凯归。\n（见《钦定盘山志》卷一、《日下旧闻考》卷一一六。\n）（按：顾炎武《金石文字记》卷五《盘山题名》云：「蓟州西北三十里盘山上有『李靖舞剑台，李从简曾游』十大字，刻於石。\n」复引《册府元龟》谓从简爲文宗开成初人。\n又按：《全芳备祖前集》卷十一收李靖「泽兰多衆芳，妍姿不相匹」爲李德裕诗，已收入《全唐诗》卷四七五。\n此因二人皆封卫国公而致误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李靖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52094.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52094","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}